 "header": [
  "The page's plan for N64Recomp-browser's tools/play_page.mjs, its regular play of about 2 minutes: the launcher, Load",
  "ROM on a new profile once the shader list Chrome builds behind it is done (Firefox builds none there and says so),",
  "Start Game, the legal screen, the logos and the intro until the title menu (tools/survey.js reads the main loop's",
  "state), then A (Space) until the game starts, as a player does. The first level's fly-over plays 20 s, then the",
  "player walks (C-up, the up arrow), turns (the stick, A and D), jumps (A) and fires the bow (Z, Q) about the level,",
  "and opens and closes the pause menu (Start, Enter). Its waits and holds are on the browser's clock: the game keeps no",
  "clock of its own the survey reads yet."
